refactor: remove packages/cloud, rewire desktop to ieom-api WebSocket

- Delete packages/cloud and packages/cloud-ui (moved to ieom-api repo)
- Rewrite cloud-signaling.ts from Socket.IO to native WebSocket (ws)
- Connect to ieom-api at ws://<host>/ws/rooms/<roomId>?token=<jwt>
- Add exponential backoff reconnection logic
- Replace socket.io-client dependency with ws
- Update pnpm-workspace.yaml, root package.json scripts
- Update ARCHITECTURE.md to reflect ieom-api as external server
